Subject: [PATCH] feat(dashboard): Linear-quality multi-view app (v2)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rebuild the single page into a routed app shell: fixed sidebar + hash-routed
views, each with Refresh + updated-stamp. Six views:
- Work Board (Kanban) — independent-scroll columns; Tasks<->Epics level
  toggle; clicking an epic focuses the task board to its children.
- Epics/Initiatives — Linear-style table, expandable parent->child hierarchy,
  derived health, done/total progress, Active/Planned/Completed/All tabs.
- Decisions & Architecture — kernel decisions + prime headline PDs + ADRs.
- Plans & History — docs/work timeline grouped by month.
- Live Ops — git worktrees, gh PRs, active claims.
- Overview — health tiles + distributions + recent activity.
Global search spans issues+epics+decisions. Body never scrolls horizontally;
column scroll is isolated (both verified in-browser).

Snapshot generator v2 emits decisions/architecture/plans/ops sections.
app.test.js extended (epicRollup + epicHealth); 7 tests pass.

Refs: 21cc7139-b088-4e23-a69c-82840e170394

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
